@startuml GetProfileListAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
GetProfileListAsync – Retrieve All Profiles
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Profile" as profColl #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  Requests the complete list of all profiles
end note

requestor -> profColl: (none)
activate profColl

profColl -> jd: read profile-collection
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> profColl: full profile-collection
deactivate jd

note over profColl
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Extract all profiles from profile-collection  
  - Prepare response list of profile objects
  - Return list of profile objects
end note

profColl --> requestor: List of Profiles
deactivate profColl

@enduml
